# Code ownership -> review routing. GitHub requests review from the owner automatically on any PR that
# touches a matching path. This is a small, single-maintainer library, so the default owner is the
# maintainer; the specific rules exist to make the SAFETY-CRITICAL and CONTRACT paths impossible to
# change without that being visible in the review — not to distribute ownership.

# Default owner for everything.
*                              @zgranowitz

# Safety-critical: pairing (JPAKE + legacy V1) and per-command HMAC signing. A wrong byte can
# misdose insulin; everything here is byte-exact against the cliparser oracle.
/Sources/TandemAuth/           @zgranowitz
/Sources/CMbedTLSJPAKE/        @zgranowitz

# The wire format, the connection state machine and the Core Bluetooth link.
/Sources/TandemMessages/       @zgranowitz
/Sources/TandemLink/           @zgranowitz
/Sources/TandemBLE/            @zgranowitz

# The build graph + vendoring + the oracle pin (no .unsafeFlags here: apps pin TandemKit releases by version).
/Package.swift                 @zgranowitz
/.gitmodules                   @zgranowitz
/PINNED.md                     @zgranowitz

# CI, the branch model, governance, and provenance — how the project proves itself.
/.github/                      @zgranowitz
/BRANCHES.md                   @zgranowitz
/CONTRIBUTING.md               @zgranowitz
/docs/SBOM.md                  @zgranowitz
